1	/**
2	 * Stripe Billing adapter. One probe = a fresh billing world on its own test clock (product,
3	 * prices, coupons, customer, subscription), then one `create_preview` of the probed change. The
4	 * same code runs against Stripe test mode and against the clone: only the SDK's host changes.
5	 */
